(i.e., staying level 1 until you get to the minetown by relying on
Elbereth and your pet).
 
1) If you drink all your potions, you will have an excellent starting
hp.
 
2) You're smart enough to have good results with "Elbereth"
 
3) If you start with enough spell energy to cast healing, you can use
